YAADE ABBAS MEIN ZAINAB NE PUKAARA ABBAS <br>
DASHT MEIN CHHOD GAYE KYON MUJHE TANHA ABBAS<br>
<br>
QHALB ZAKHMI HAI MERA KAISE SANBHALOON QUD KO,<br>
 MERI AANKHAON MEIN HAI AKBAR KA KALEJA ABBAS<br>
<br>
TERE MARNE NE KAMAR TOODI MERA BHAYI KI,<br>
 DEGA MAAJAYE KO AB KOUN SAHARA ABAAS<br>
<br>
SUNTI HU HAATH KATE SAR PA LAGA GURZ TERE,<br>
 KAISE TUHJ PAR YE SITAM HOGAYE BHAIYYA ABBAS<br>
<br>
AB NA QASIM HAI NA AKBER HAI NA BHAYI SHABBIR,<br>
 BEKASAON KA NAHI AB KOI SAHARA ABBAS<br>
<br>
TERE DAM SE THI HAR EK BIBI KE DIL KO DHARAS,<br>
 AB HAR EK LAB PA HAI BAS TERA HI NOUHA ABBAS<br>
<br>
AAG KHAIMAON MEIN LAGI BISTARE BIMAAR JALA,<br>
 JALGAYA ASGHAR-E-BESHEER KA JHOOLA ABBAS<br>
<br>
KAAN BHI ZAKHMI HAIN RUQHSAAR BHI ZAKHMI USKE,<br>
 KAISE DOON TERI SAKINA KO DILASA ABBAS<br>
<br>
KAMSINI MEIN HAIN SAKINA PE MAZALIM PAIHAM,<br>
 USKA AB KOI NAHIN POOCHNE WALA ABBAS<br>
<br>
SAR PA CHADAR NAHIN BAZOO MEIN RASAN HAI MERE,<br>
 DEKHTE KYON NAHIN AAKAR MERE BHAIYYA ABBAS<br>
<br>
MUSHKILEN DUR HUI MUJHSE USI LAMHA RASHEED,<br>
 MAINE JAB TOOTE HUE DIL SE PUKARA ABBAS..